{"version":1,"content":"<p>同是前港姐冠軍的郭羨妮與楊思琦有女初長成，前者演出舞台劇時，女兒Kylie現身撐場，更與媽媽齊齊站台，絲毫沒有怯場，更被讚有條件參選港姐；</p><p>而楊思琦的囡囡遺傳其「慳妹」性格，喜歡親自下廚，盡顯孝心。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T13:43:49.191762+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T12:36:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:37:14.464268+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T13:37:14.464268+00:00","content_hash":"20f9bfa4dcef99adf154bc1f0f992d78903c683000e2223cae8de09d7d700e63","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}